        <terms:description rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">A coherent unit of measurement for a unit system is a defined unit that may be expressed as a product of powers of the system&apos;s base units with the proportionality factor of one.</terms:description>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://qudt.org/2.1/schema/qudt"/>
